%description:
Tests RFC 6675 section 5.1 (decision D-34 of the staged landing): after an RTO
during a loss recovery, "a new recovery phase (as described in Section 5) MUST
NOT be initiated until HighACK is greater than or equal to the new value of
RecoveryPoint". The tester deletes the first segment and its fast
retransmission, and it delays the new segment 2001:2501 of the fast recovery,
so the timeout at t=4 comes during the fast recovery. The duplicate ACK of
t=4.002 then starts no new fast recovery, so the window stays in the slow
start of the timeout: 500 bytes, and 1000 bytes after the ACK of t=4.003,
which completes the recovery of the timeout. A new recovery would set it to
ssthresh, 1250 bytes. tcp_frto_4 is the same with F-RTO.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.cli_app.sendScript="1 2500"
*.*_tcp.advertisedWindow = 5000
*.*_tcp.sackSupport = true
*.*_tcp.mss = 500
*.*_tcp.increasedIWEnabled = true
*.tcptester.script="a3 delete; a7 delete; a8 delay 2.995"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[1.005 A007] A.1000 > B.2000: A 1:501(500) ack 501 win 5000 # deleting
[1.005 A008] A.1000 > B.2000: A 2001:2501(500) ack 501 win 5000 # removing original
[4.000 A008] A.1000 > B.2000: A 2001:2501(500) ack 501 win 5000 # introducing copy
[4.001 A009] A.1000 > B.2000: A 1:501(500) ack 501 win 5000 
[4.002 B005] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 1 win 5000   Option(s): NOP NOP SACK[501,2501)
[4.003 B006] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 2501 win 5000 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
No new loss recovery before the RecoveryPoint of the RTO (RFC 6675 section 5.1)
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
cwnd <= ssthresh: Slow Start: increasing cwnd by 500 bytes to cwnd=1000
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
